    "identifier": "water-release-supreme-water-lion",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a huge construct made of water &amp; chakra forming a Supreme Water Lion, of your description.</p>\n<p>The Supreme Water Lion has the listed statistics found on its stat block in the Summon Stat Blocks section and use your Ninjutsu attack bonus or Ninjutsu Save DC when an effect calls for it. You can command them as a Bonus action.</p>\n<p>You can as a bonus action on your turn, so long as you are in physical contact with this construct merge into its head. While you are merged in this way you have total Cover against attacks and other effects outside of the Lion.</p>",
